Z||000005||Formula88||09-20-2001||10:31 PM||||Good speech.  Very firm.  Very positive.  And Hillary was the only person in the room that I saw that didn't look 100% behind the President.  I never liked her much, but I like her even less now.  She could at least give the impression of solidarity.  Hell, the Democratic leader didn't respond after the speech because they wanted America to speak with one voice.  Hillary looked like she'd rather be doing it herself.  ||||reg||1
Z||000006||FieroKyle||09-20-2001||10:34 PM||||yeah he made a point, but between pauses he is trying so hard not smirk cuz he is thinking, they actually clapping for me, they like me. he think he Mr. Cool and great being president. I like Clinton so much better than him. I just wonder what Gore would have did. Bush is such loser.||||reg||1
Z||000007||maryjane||09-20-2001||10:41 PM||||Could have been a little stronger, but very effective. I voted for him. Wasn't happy with the way he got elected (the whole Fla/Supreme court thing), but Believe we've got the right man. As for Hillary, didn't a house fall on her sister in the Wizard of Oz?<BR>Oh, my mistake. That was spelled with a 'W' not a 'B'.||||reg||1
Z||000008||tgowens||09-20-2001||10:48 PM||||I think it was a very powerful and moving speech. He has the support of many nations and that was evidenced by some of the representation there.<P>I am just concerned that his pronounciation of the word "terrorist" sounds so much like the word "tourist".........we don't need a war against tourists!!||||reg||1
Z||000009||Patrick's Dad||09-20-2001||11:32 PM||||&lt;quote&gt; he think (sic) he Mr. Cool and great being president. I like Clinton so much better than him. I just wonder what Gore would have did (sic). Bush is such loser (sic). &lt;/quote&gt;<P>Kyle, my wife and I were just musing about that second to last thought, though in a grammatically correct sort of way. My wife thought that he'd likely be hiding under a desk. Myself, I think that he'd be looking for alternative attacks, ones that didn't use so much of that polluting jet fuel, or destroy so much of the beautiful, natural Afghani countryside.<P>Of course, since he knows so much more than you and I do, Mr. Gore proabaly would have stopped the attacks himself. Singlehandedly.<P>Mr. Gore may have been a passable statesman, brought to center stage by a scandal ridden, power hungry perjuror. He was or is no leader. I'm glad that we have not only a man that seems to be rising to the occasion, but who has a vision of treading through this mire with our dignity intact. He showed me more of that this evening. As long as we continue to put men like him in the big chair, I believe more and more that we will be able to hand to our children a world that is better and safer than we found it to our children.<P>Tonight, I think that I'll E-Mail my brother (ANG) with thanks for serving, despite what I thought of his C in C. I'll also thank my father (Navy) tomorrow morning when I hand my daughter over to him for the day. And soon, we'll go to my father in law's grave (Army) (thankfully, he didn't live to see this....) and say a quiet "thank you."||||reg||1
Z||000010||frontal lobe||09-20-2001||11:35 PM||||"...he think he Mr. Cool..."!!!???   What?????  All that is going on, and all that is going to happen, and you REALLY think he's up there thinking he is Mr. Cool?  Well that is just absolutely incredible.<P>There are many who put so much weight on how well someone gives a speech (Clinton) and not the content of it and the conviction behind it.  The content of Bush's speech was excellent.  The conviction was excellent.  The delivery is minor, but I thought he was excellent in that area as well.  <P>I'm not going to say anything more of what I am thinking right now, because I want to be as non-partison and unified as possible during this time.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000011||Sootah||09-21-2001||12:03 AM||||Just got done listening to a re-run of Bush's speech. I'd go into a long dissection of his speech, but I'd rather not. Lets just say that the part of it I heard, I totally agreed with.<P>-<B><I>Sootah</I></B>||||reg||1
