Z||000023||87GTBro||09-21-2001||12:13 PM||||I am extremely happy with the way President Bush is handling this.  I proudly voted for him as president and I have never regretted it.<P>It made me sick that he was torn apart by the media during the election, but what is the media doing now?  Nothing but praise.<P>We have always needed a God-fearing man in the White House.  Now we've got one, and the nation is happy.<P>He is getting my vote again in 2004!<BR>||||reg||1
