Z||000025||stimpy||09-21-2001||05:18 PM||||Wow, thar's some touchy folks round these here parts! To Frontal Lobe, while I'm not a big fan per se of Lady 'Illary, she did actually become a very successful attorney at one time, and managed to be elected senator in a state she moved to.(see <B>carpetbagger</B>) I'd say that would take some persuasive speaking ability. So she's a cold ***** . If she were a man, you'd love her steely resolve. Nothing more American then the ol' double standard.<BR>Jeff (88GT), I always enjoy agreeing to disagree with you. You're all right. While it's true academic standards at Ivy League schools are high for the average Joe, if you were an admissions officer at Yale, would you turn away the progeny of an Alumnus, a member of the powerful and elite Skull and Bones, who also happened to be the director of the CIA? If you could, you have bigger balls then I, Gunga Din.<BR>Finally Voytek. Voytek, Voytek, Voytek. What am I gonna do with you? Since when does personal <B>OPINION</B> have to be supported by fact? Untwist your panties, chief. I was not stating that as factual scientific data, proved beyond doubt by mountains of empirical evidence. I just stated what I think. And I'll reserve my right to continue to do so, thank you very much!||||reg||1
