Z||000027||frontal lobe||09-21-2001||06:17 PM||||Stimpy, just wanted you to know that the LAST thing I would do is get in a tiff with a friend about HILLARY!  <P>Yes, she is a successful lawyer and would have done that on her own.  Politics, it's a lot about having the right connections (yes, that goes for President Bush, too).  Regarding her speech ability, I don't think that's what got her elected.  I felt she got elected INSPITE of her speech ability, because she comes across as such a HAG.<P>That has nothing to do with not respecting women with steely resolve, because there are plently of women in american politics who can do that without being a HAG.  If she were a man (which is NOT hard to imagine) I would not admire her/his steely resolve.  I would just be substituting a more male directed word for HAG.||||reg||1
