Z||000029||Galen||09-21-2001||06:53 PM||||Who the &%^% cares how well he gives speeches? Seemed like Clinton was really good at talking, and thats about it. I personally dont care if the man can't give  a speech well, as long as he do the job. Which he is showing he is plenty able to do. <P>Stimpy, you wanna get into a fight? Come on big guy, first I'll take them legs out. Then smack around with a Monica Cigar  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/g-flag-sig.gif">  <FONT COLOR="purple">1988 Hawaiin Orchid Coupe</FONT> - <A HREF="http://www.fierolinks.f2s.com/" TARGET=_blank>Fierolinks</A>||||reg||1
